// Enterprise admin console: access management with a dense data table and a side panel
// Shows: a 1584 px application frame made of library instances: header, side navigation, table toolbar, batch-action bar, table header, rows filled through cell properties and the nested status tag, pagination, and an edit panel with form states and a notification (the breadcrumb, page title and tabs are local layers on the same tokens); the same screen in Gray 100 by setting four modes; a compact copy by switching the Size property of the header and the rows; the table when it is empty, loading and not permitted
// in: 11-enterprise/51-enterprise-component-library-on-carbon-tokens
// The chrome, the tables and the form controls of these screens are instances of library components; page titles, tabs and the few parts no other screen shares are local layers on the same tokens. Find the mains once; node.find matches names as substrings, so each name here is unique in the file.
